          "path": "_m/9/q/c/0/carquinez-strait-wp/carquinez-strait-panorama.jpg",
          "filename": "Carquinez Strait Panorama.jpg",
          "caption": "Shot just before dusk on a cloudy day (a bit hazy and noisy). Wanted to see how well I could stitch without (again) my tripod. Carquinez Strait connects San Pablo Bay with Suisun Bay in the San Francisco Bay Area of California. On the other side of the bridge is the old Mothball Fleet.\n\nThis was taken on a hike at Carquinez Strait Regional Shoreline, at the top of the Hulet Hornbeck trail. The park's name is a bit misleading since it also rises above the shoreline onto some reasonably steep hills.",
          "alt": "Shot just before dusk on a cloudy day (a bit hazy and noisy). Wanted to see how well I could stitch without (again) my tripod. Carquinez Strait connects San Pablo Bay with Suisun Bay in the San Francisco Bay Area of California. On the other side of the bridge is the old Mothball Fleet.\n\nThis was taken on a hike at Carquinez Strait Regional Shoreline, at the top of the Hulet Hornbeck trail. The park's name is a bit misleading since it also rises above the shoreline onto some reasonably steep hills.",
